✈️ Powerful air strikes

▪️ Four FAB-500 aerial bombs with unified gliding and correction module hit a UAV command post of the 117th Separate Mechanised Brigade near Rayskoye in the Donetsk People's Republic;

▪️ A Kh-38 ML rocket flew precisely into a temporary deployment area of the 22nd Separate Mechanised Brigade near Udy in Kharkov region;

▪️ Two FAB-500 bombs with unified gliding and correction module destroyed a UAV command post of the 13th Operational Brigade (National Guard of Ukraine) near Krasnopolye in Sumy region.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

Семье бывшего министра обороны РФ Сергея Иванова, который умер 26 июня, принадлежит несколько объектов недвижимости общей стоимостью 4,2 миллиарда рублей

